sec.p:
Institutional and technological convergence: Governance and innovation indicators display relative uniformity. The IQRL is concentrated around a high average (1.27; 

    σ

 = 0.61), while R&amp;D intensity exhibits a similar profile (average: 1.83%; 

    σ

 = 0.98). These low dispersions suggest a convergence of political and scientific models within the group.
